正常值范围","各访视检查对应表","非临床安全性数据"],"proposal_text":"本方案安全性终点包含临床实验室检查异常发生率，排除标准涉及eGFR（<30 mL/min/1.73m²）及ALT/AST（>3×ULN）的筛选期检测。研究访视安排为筛选访视（V1，-28至-1天）、基线随机访视（V2，第1天）、第2/4/8/12周门诊访视（V3至V6）、治疗结束访视（V7，第12周）及末次给药后28天安全性随访访视（V8）。本章节应列明完整的实验室检查项目清单、各访视对应的采集项目与时间点、正常值范围、异常分级标准及异常处理流程。上述内容本章节尚未确定，需依据SGC-R1L3的非临床安全性数据及项目安全性监测计划进一步制定。","rationale":"安全性终点已确认包含临床实验室检查异常发生率；排除标准已确认涉及eGFR和ALT/AST检测；访视策略已确认V1至V8安排。但具体实验室检查项目清单、各访视采集对应关系、正常值范围及异常处理流程在允许来源中未给出，不得由访视日推断每个访视均实施全部检查。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_3ea77adeef20_1d5c354849d6b27c","section_number":"14.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:99d077c9dae1e87b713567ca","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"639a5da7ef7875d25e0ed1f4ebd42fd3cb7ee644bf96f39b2a711b1bc209d7ca","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_3ea77adeef20_fe65ac8ebe5656d4:full-draft:99d077c9dae1e87b713567ca","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:99d077c9dae1e87b713567ca","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:f7cad6dd41a53dd961c595f921f126425c5cf6efe0ee27d189f890cb1954cb56:99d077c9dae1e87b713567ca","text_sha256":"639a5da7ef7875d25e0ed1f4ebd42fd3cb7ee644bf96f39b2a711b1bc209d7ca"},{"content_sha256":"db9b92d12e178aa2ca2e7a7f27910eba0a468cd52f76daba8dc1e7f0b82160dc","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_37371f37a7aa3367e47a:r4:d791f4ccd862320e","text_sha256":"db9b92d12e178aa2ca2e7a7f27910eba0a468cd52f76daba8dc1e7f0b82160dc"}]}